(-.35,.65,.4),([-.99,.95],[-.65,1],[0,.98]),('An advanced resident order permits a floor with household coverage uncertain.','Resident agency is central with hierarchy and network constraints possible.','Useful mixed-person activity counts; information and species counts are not participation.'),
